esword4linux (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial native Debian package for Ubuntu 24.04 LTS and Linux Mint 22.x.
  * Bundle PySide6-Essentials 6.12.0, shiboken6 6.12.0 and pure-Python
    PyYAML 6.0.3 in a private runtime under /opt/esword4linux.
  * Retain the X11 (xcb) and Wayland client Qt platform plugins together with
    the image-format plugins used by e-Sword modules.
  * Install the desktop entry, hicolor icons, man page and license texts.
  * Keep settings and indexes in the XDG user directories; never modify the
    user's e-Sword modules folder.

 -- Felipe <felotrrs@gmail.com>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:00:00 +0000
